OL,3,GNEWSADad high on cocaine who stole
OL,4,Aminibus, drove wrong way on A55 and hit
OL,5,Aa cyclist jailed
OL,6,
OL,7,FA dad-of-two high on drink and drugs
OL,8,Fwho stole a minibus, hit a cyclist and
OL,9,Fdrove the wrong way along a dual
OL,10,Fcarriageway has been jailed.
OL,12,FDarragh O'Grady, 31, from Dublin,
OL,13,Farrived by ferry in Holyhead, Anglesey,
OL,14,Fwhere he stole a woman's phone and her
OL,15,Fbank cards that he used to spend
OL,16,Fbetween #100 and #200.
OL,18,FSentencing O'Grady at Caernarfon Crown
OL,19,FCourt to three years, Judge Betts said
OL,20,Fit was "only a matter of sheer luck
OL,21,Fthat you didn't kill yourself or
OL,22,Fsomeone else".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
